menu "ESP-Brookesia: GUI GSP Configurations"

    config BROOKESIA_GUI_GSP_ENABLE_DEBUG_LOG
        bool "Enable debug log for the GSP GUI adapter"
        default n
        help
            Enable trace and debug logs for GSP session start and stop.

    config BROOKESIA_GSP_COMPRESS_COMPILED_BUNDLES
        bool "Compress embedded Brookesia GSP bundles"
        depends on SPIRAM
        default n
        help
            Keep GSPC's original bundle and generated headers at build time,
            but embed a lossless zlib envelope in the firmware. The active
            bundle is expanded into PSRAM for the lifetime of its GSP session.

endmenu
